		note {
			value """
Comments on "Sandy Privacy Torture" INDIVIDUAL Record.

This record has a restriction setting of "privacy." In public applications of GEDCOM files, "privacy" records should be hidden from all viewing and printing. It is less clear how GEDCOM software on your own PC reading your own copies of GEDCOM files should treat "privacy" records. At a minimum, it should import and preserve the "privacy" setting."""
			audit {
				creation {
					date 2026-08-27T00:00:00Z
					comment From GEDCOM conversion
				}
			}
		}
		note {
			value Child of family: @FAMILY1@
			audit {
